        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WBR2847, Solid Brass 28-1/2\" Rectangular Wire Basket</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAt 28-1/2\" long and 5\" wide, the Deltana Rectangular Wire Shelf is great for holding all your bathroom supplies from shampoo bottles to body wash. Its longer length means that there is plenty of room for shared bathrooms where everyone had their own soaps. But don't think that this shelf is made for the bathroom alone. It is the perfect solution for storage issues all over your home; and would be great for storing ingredients in your kitchen or toys in the kid's rooms. Made out of solid brass, the WBR2847 Wire Basket is available in polished chrome and satin nickel finishes. It easily mounts to the wall.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBR2847-specifications.gif?v=1704354647\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana WBR2847 28-1/2\" Rectangular Wire Basket Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/collections/bathroom-hardware-1\"><b>Deltana Wire Baskets</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the WBR2847 Solid Brass Rectangular Basket:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 28-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBR2847.pdf?v=1704262292\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana WBR2847 28-1/2\" Rectangular Wire Basket Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 basket, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>",
